---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { agent, brokerage } from '../config/site';
import { rich } from '../lib/text';
const who = `${agent.name} and ${brokerage.name}`;
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${agent.name} collects, uses and protects your information.`} updated="November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains how <span set:html={rich(who)} /> (“we,” “us”) collect, use and share information when you visit this website or contact us.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us</strong> — such as your name, email, phone number, property address, home-search preferences and any message you send through a form.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage and device information</strong> — pages viewed, links clicked, approximate location, browser and device type, collected through cookies and similar technologies.</li>
    <li><strong>Campaign information</strong> — how you arrived at the site (for example, an ad or search result), including UTM parameters and ad click identifiers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your requests, prepare home valuations, send listing alerts, guides and market updates.</li>
    <li>To provide real estate services and keep records required of licensees and brokerages.</li>
    <li>To understand how the site is used and improve it.</li>
    <li>To measure and improve our advertising.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies, analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>We may use Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, Google Ads and the Meta (Facebook/Instagram) Pixel and Conversions API. These services use cookies and similar technologies to measure site activity and ad performance, and may receive information such as pages visited and the fact that a form was submitted. You can limit this through your browser’s cookie settings, <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google’s opt-out</a> and your <a href="https://www.facebook.com/adpreferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meta ad preferences</a>.</p>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>With our brokerage, <span set:html={rich(brokerage.name)} />, and with service providers that help us operate (such as website hosting, form processing, CRM, email and texting platforms), only as needed to provide services.</li>
    <li>With parties to a real estate transaction (for example, lenders, title companies or other agents) when you ask us to help you buy or sell.</li>
    <li>When required by law or to protect rights and safety.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong> Mobile phone numbers and text-messaging opt-in data and consent are never shared with third parties or affiliates for their marketing purposes.</p>

  <h2>Text messages</h2>
  <p>If you opt in to texts, see our <a href="/sms-terms/">SMS Terms</a>. Reply STOP at any time to opt out.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your information, or to stop contacting you, by emailing <span set:html={rich(agent.email)} /> or calling <span set:html={rich(agent.phoneDisplay)} />. Email messages include an unsubscribe link.</p>

  <h2>Data security & retention</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information and keep it only as long as needed for the purposes above or as required by law.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy and will post the new version here with a revised date.</p>
</LegalPage>
